    "title": "We Have a Right to Protect Our Data, Opt Out of Companies' AI Scheme and Ads: Specialist | NTD",
    "text": "Joel Thayer, president of the Digital Progress Institute, discussed with Steve Lance, NTD Washington Bureau Chief, and host of Capitol Report, a recent Pew study finding the majority of Americans say they feel they have no control over their data. Thayer also discussed China's obsession with collecting data on every other country, the Minnesota Consumer Data Privacy Act that will go into effect on July 31, and the presence of the Big Tech lobby in Washington.\nWe Have a Right to Protect Our Data, Opt Out of Companies' AI Scheme and Ads: Specialist\nJoel Thayer, president of the Digital Progress Institute, discusses a recent Pew study finding the majority of Americans say they feel they have no control over their data.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 7/30/2025, 11:57:12 PM EDT",
